    "title": "One Block Lucky Mod for MCPE",
    "description": "One Block Lucky Mod for MCPE!\r\n\r\nIntroducing the One Block Lucky Mod for MCPE, the ultimate companion app for MCPE players seeking a unique and thrilling survival experience! Dive into the captivating world where you start with just a single square and embark on an extraordinary journey through limitless possibilities.\ud83d\udd25\r\nIn the application you will find maps and mods:\r\n\u201cOne Block survival map for MCPE\u201d - You begin with only one block you're standing on - the goal is to survive and kill the dragon. Destroy the block underneath you to get the new one - sometimes you will get the chest, and sometimes a monster. \r\n\u201cLucky Block addon\u201d - Lucky Block addon is all about win or lose, and there's nothing to rely on except luck. All you'll need to do is to find as much gold as possible and craft Lucky blocks. On top of gold, you will require a bunch of Blaze rods, but that shouldn't be a problem either.\r\n\u201cOne Skyblock map\u201d - I want to present you yet another One Block style map but with some upgrades. The basics are the same, you start on one block, and by destroying it constantly, you will be getting random blocks to be used for your needs.\r\n\u201cRainbow One block map\u201d - You start your crazy survival journey on a lonely rainbow block that contains random items. Pretty standard start, but there are a couple of twists that made this map unique. First of all, custom rainbow items - that can speed up the monotonous process of breaking up the block over and over again. \r\n\u201cRandom One Block map\u201d - You start on one block - destroy it to get another one but completely random. This map is a variation of the famous one block survival, but even harder. \r\n\u201cSkyblock islands map for Minecraft PE\u201d - The map has the same rules as a regular skyblock, just with a bigger amount of islands. The main thing that makes the difference between this and the other maps of this kind is the additional islands that float around and create possibilities for further development of your survival.\r\n\u201cRandom Skyblock map for Minecraft PE\u201d - The main feature of the Random Skyblock map is that it generates random blocks and events. The starting island looks the same - a tree, a little to no resources, and few chests. But when you start walking out of the island's borders, you'll notice that you're not falling, and random blocks start spawning beneath your feet. \r\n\u201cSkyFactory map\u201d - SkyFactory is a survival map in the era of the industrial revolution in Minecraft. You will start from scratch on a small island without any resources on it. \u201c15 Lucky Blocks mod\u201d - Craft 15 types of Lucky Blocks and take your chances of getting every item in Minecraft PE almost for free. Every type of lucky block has different content you can get, both in case of a good and bad outcome. \r\n\u201cLucky Block Race map\u201d - Lucky Block race - is a fun minigame, in which you and up to three of your friends can test your luck. How to play: you and at least one of your friends must stand at the beginning - each on their own track, make a countdown, and start running destroying all lucky blocks on your way. \r\n\r\nMinecraft One Block Features:\r\n\u2b50Minecraft One Block Maps\r\n\u2b50Skyblock MCPE Mods - Enjoy different sky block maps!\r\n\u2b50Get Minerals\r\n\u2b50Open Chests\r\n\u2b50Win the Skywars battle!\r\n\r\nThe Minecraft One Block Map is a genuinely concept, offering an exhilarating gameplay experience unlike anything you've encountered. \r\nMaps Made For Every Level of Gamer!\ud83c\udfae\r\nWhether you're a seasoned Minecraft veteran or a curious newcomer to the world, this One Block Minecraft app offers an unparalleled adventure. Discover the joys of survival and the thrill of conquering challenges in the Minecraft one block universe.\r\n\r\n-Disclaimer\r\nThis app is owned by us and is not an official Minecraft application. We are not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with Minecraft or Mojang Studios.\r\n\r\nThank you very much for your five star rating and review!\r\nYour comments are welcome!\r\nContact :\t\t\r\nEmail - minecraftpemods.games@gmail.com",
